<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Admission Services. Upon further review of your student’s question, Admission Services has transferred case number {!Case.Thread_Id} to University Registrar Services. If you need more information, you can find it on the case details in Salesforce.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><a href="http://asu.edu">asu.edu</a></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>